1
00:00:00,398 --> 00:00:02,808
(Arthur:)Trust me, I... I remember.

2
00:00:03,601 --> 00:00:05,201
(Sheldon:)This is my girlfriend, Amy.

3
00:00:05,369 --> 00:00:07,319
(Sheldon:)Amy, this is television
legend Arthur Jeffries.

4
00:00:07,471 --> 00:00:11,381
(Sheldon:)His science show
inspired millions of children.

5
00:00:11,542 --> 00:00:14,112
(Arthur:)Hold... Hold on.

6
00:00:14,278 --> 00:00:16,758
(Arthur:)You... You have a girlfriend?

7
00:00:17,715 --> 00:00:19,825
(Amy:)Yes, and I've heard
so much about you.

8
00:00:19,984 --> 00:00:22,654
(Amy:)Hey, look, we're wearing
the same orthopedic shoes.

9
00:00:24,422 --> 00:00:26,562
(Amy:)I can't believe I dress
like a celebrity.

10
00:00:29,126 --> 00:00:31,336
(Arthur:)Okay, I get it now.

11
00:00:32,997 --> 00:00:35,277
(Leonard:)Dr. Jeffries, hello again.
Leonard Hofstadter.

12
00:00:35,433 --> 00:00:38,503
(Arthur:)Oh, oh, right,
I remember your girlfriend.

13
00:00:40,571 --> 00:00:43,681
(Arthur:)Is she... is she here?

14
00:00:43,841 --> 00:00:45,341
(Leonard:)No, she's not.

15
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:48,290
(Sheldon:)So, what prescription
are you getting filled?

16
00:00:48,446 --> 00:00:49,756
(Sheldon:)-Sheldon.
-No. Wait, I want to guess.

17
00:00:49,914 --> 00:00:50,914
(Sheldon:)Don't tell me.

18
00:00:51,082 --> 00:00:53,462
(Arthur:)I wasn't going to tell you.

19
00:00:54,585 --> 00:00:55,655
(Amy:)Sheldon, come on.

20
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:57,820
(Sheldon:)No, no, no. I'm really good at this.
All right, give me a hint.

21
00:00:57,989 --> 00:01:01,999
(Sheldon:)Does it involve difficulty initiating
a stream of anything?

22
00:01:03,861 --> 00:01:07,601
(Arthur:)Well, given my age,
thats more than just a lucky guess.

23
00:01:08,699 --> 00:01:10,439
(Leonard:)Hey, Sheldon,
let's go mock the people

24
00:01:10,601 --> 00:01:13,341
(Leonard:)buying homeopathic medicine.
You love that.

25
00:01:13,504 --> 00:01:15,714
(Sheldon:)But I'm hanging out with my friend,
and we're having fun.

26
00:01:15,873 --> 00:01:21,023
Look how happy he ls.

